# Test 1480's response file: every source it adds, one a line, comments and
# blank lines skipped, each path relative to this file rather than to where
# the compiler was started.

1480_response_file_listed.cor

# And a flag, passed on as it is: a line that begins with '-' is one
# argument, so a flag with a value is written --cpu=486 (a value alone on a
# line would be taken for a source beside this file).
--cpu=486
